      "leaf_matches": [
        {
          "slug": "legal-billing-application",
          "reason": "官方首页 FAQ 将其定义为构建在 QuickBooks Online 上的法律计费与会计软件，覆盖 time tracking、billing、trust accounting、payments 与 real-time reporting，并按 hourly、flat-fee、contingency matters 运行；官方时间与费用页写明每条时间可分配 client、matter、timekeeper、rate 与 narrative，费用按 matter 记录，随后进入 invoice review and approval workflow，并支持 UTBMS/LEDES 编码（比较页注明 LEDES 支持随方案而异）；官方比较页进一步写明 client and matter trust workflows with three-way reconciliation、batch billing、online payments，并明确“LeanLaw is not a full case-management suite”“does not try to replace every case, document, intake, or CRM tool”，属于与案件/文档工具并行的 billing-first 财务层，符合本叶独立 money loop 边界。",
